      "tagline": "Production-ready predictive intelligence, computer vision, forecasting, recommendation systems, and MLOps.",
      "summary": "Production-ready AI and machine learning solutions for predictive intelligence, intelligent decision support, computer vision, forecasting, recommendation systems, and enterprise AI applications.",
      "description": "Production-ready AI and machine learning solutions for predictive intelligence, intelligent decision support, computer vision, forecasting, recommendation systems, and enterprise AI applications.",
      "content": "### WHAT WE DO\n\nWe engineer production-ready AI and machine learning solutions for predictive intelligence, intelligent decision support, computer vision, forecasting, recommendation systems, and enterprise AI applications.\n\n### BUSINESS PROBLEMS SOLVED\n\n- **Operational Unpredictability:** High scrap rates and unpredicted machinery faults due to lack of predictive anomaly detection.\n- **Manual Quality Bottlenecks:** Human inspection errors and slow throughput on high-speed production lines.\n- **Forecast Inaccuracy:** Siloed inventory spreadsheets causing stockouts and capital tie-up.\n- **Experimental ML Churn:** Fragmented notebook models failing to deliver real-time production inference.\n\n### HOW WE ENGINEER IT\n\n- **Production MLOps Pipelines:** Sub-50ms inference engines with automated model drift detection, shadow deployments, and continuous retraining.\n- **Computer Vision Optical Inspection:** Real-time edge defect identification running on low-power inference hardware.\n- **Deterministic Forecasting Models:** Domain-tuned time-series forecasting integrated directly with ERP and supply chain systems.\n- **Intelligent Decision Engines:** Multi-criteria scoring and recommendation systems for operational resource allocation.\n\n### BUSINESS OUTCOMES\n\n- **95% Reduction** in manual inspection bottlenecks\n- **Sub-50ms Inference Latency** for real-time edge decisions\n- **Zero-Downtime Model Rollouts** with blue/green deployment safety\n- **30% Improvement** in forecast accuracy across seasonal cycles",
