    {
      "id": "srv_04",
      "title": "Generative AI & Agentic AI",
      "slug": "generative-agentic-ai",
      "num": "04",
      "tagline": "LLM-powered assistants, retrieval-augmented generation, intelligent agents, and enterprise copilots.",
      "summary": "LLM-powered assistants, retrieval-augmented generation, intelligent agents, document intelligence, workflow orchestration, enterprise copilots, and AI consulting.",
      "description": "LLM-powered assistants, retrieval-augmented generation, intelligent agents, document intelligence, workflow orchestration, enterprise copilots, and AI consulting.",
      "content": "### WHAT WE DO\n\nWe design and deploy enterprise-grade Generative AI and Agentic AI systems — including contextual RAG pipelines, autonomous multi-agent swarms, document intelligence engines, and secure enterprise copilots.\n\n### BUSINESS PROBLEMS SOLVED\n\n- **Manual Document Overhead:** Thousands of engineer hours lost manually auditing contracts, invoices, and technical specs.\n- **Hallucination & Inaccuracy:** Public AI models providing non-deterministic, ungrounded answers for critical enterprise workflows.\n- **Data Privacy & IP Exposure:** Severe risk of sensitive intellectual property leaking to third-party public model providers.\n- **Complex Multi-Step Friction:** Fragile single-prompt interactions unable to execute structured multi-step business tasks.\n\n### HOW WE ENGINEER IT\n\n- **Contextual Hybrid RAG:** Combine dense vector embeddings with sparse BM25 keyword search and re-ranking for ultra-precise retrieval.\n- **Deterministic Agent Graphs:** Stateful LangGraph agent orchestration with validation checkpoints, schema enforcement, and tool calling.\n- **Enterprise Guardrails & Privacy:** Localized data masking, PII scrubbing, and DPDP/GDPR-compliant self-hosted model gateways.\n- **Intelligent Document OCR:** Multimodal extraction pipelines transforming unstructured complex PDFs and tables into clean JSON.\n\n### BUSINESS OUTCOMES\n\n- **80% Reduction** in manual document extraction and reconciliation time\n- **99.2% Retrieval Precision** with verified citations and zero data leakage\n- **Sub-Second Response Latency** on enterprise knowledge search queries\n- **Enterprise-Wide DPDP Compliance** with full audit logging and RBAC",
      "businessProblems": [
        "Manual document auditing and unstructured contract analysis bottlenecks",
        "Complex internal engineering knowledge retrieval friction",
        "Unsafe public LLM usage exposing sensitive enterprise IP",
        "Slow multi-step business workflow execution"
      ],
      "capabilities": [
