    {
      "id": "srv_05",
      "title": "DevOps & Cloud Infrastructure",
      "slug": "devops-cloud",
      "num": "05",
      "tagline": "Cloud engineering, CI/CD, container platforms, infrastructure automation, and observability.",
      "summary": "Cloud engineering, CI/CD, container platforms, infrastructure automation, observability, platform engineering, secure deployments, and multi-cloud delivery.",
      "description": "Cloud engineering, CI/CD, container platforms, infrastructure automation, observability, platform engineering, secure deployments, and multi-cloud delivery.",
      "content": "### WHAT WE DO\n\nWe architect robust cloud infrastructure, automated GitOps CI/CD pipelines, container orchestration platforms, infrastructure-as-code automation, full-stack observability, and secure multi-cloud environments.\n\n### BUSINESS PROBLEMS SOLVED\n\n- **Slow, Error-Prone Deployments:** Manual server configurations causing frequent production regressions and release delays.\n- **Lack of Multi-Cloud Resilience:** Vendor lock-in and single-region vulnerabilities threatening business continuity.\n- **Uncontrolled Cloud Spending:** Sprawling idle compute resources inflating monthly infrastructure cloud budgets.\n- **Observability Blind Spots:** Fragmented logs and disconnected metrics obscuring root causes during critical service outages.\n\n### HOW WE ENGINEER IT\n\n- **Declarative Infrastructure as Code:** Modular Terraform and Helm templates enforcing security baselines and immutable infrastructure.\n- **Zero-Downtime GitOps CI/CD:** Automated Argo CD and GitHub Actions workflows with progressive canary and blue-green rollouts.\n- **Production Kubernetes Engineering:** Hardened multi-tenant Kubernetes clusters with autoscaling, service meshes, and network policies.\n- **Unified OpenTelemetry Observability:** Distributed tracing, centralized Prometheus metrics, and actionable Grafana dashboards.\n\n### BUSINESS OUTCOMES\n\n- **40% Cloud Infrastructure Cost Reduction** via automated FinOps optimization\n- **10x Increase in Deployment Frequency** with sub-5 minute rollback capability\n- **99.99% Service Availability** backed by automated multi-zone failover\n- **100% Infrastructure Auditability** tracked directly in version control",
      "businessProblems": [
        "Manual, error-prone server provisioning and slow release cycles",
        "Lack of distributed multi-cloud disaster recovery",
        "Unmonitored cloud spending and architectural inefficiency",
        "Security compliance gaps in container environments"
      ],
