    {
      "id": "srv_06",
      "title": "Data Governance & Quality",
      "slug": "data-governance",
      "num": "06",
      "tagline": "Enterprise data governance, quality management, metadata, lineage, and DPDP compliance.",
      "summary": "Enterprise data governance, quality management, metadata, lineage, cataloguing, master data management, privacy, security, compliance, and trustworthy data foundations.",
      "description": "Enterprise data governance, quality management, metadata, lineage, cataloguing, master data management, privacy, security, compliance, and trustworthy data foundations.",
      "content": "### WHAT WE DO\n\nWe implement enterprise data governance programs, automated data quality verification, column-level metadata lineage, cataloguing, master data management (MDM), and regulatory privacy frameworks.\n\n### BUSINESS PROBLEMS SOLVED\n\n- **Untrustworthy Executive Reports:** Business leadership making decisions based on unverified, duplicated, or stale data.\n- **Obscure Pipeline Lineage:** Engineering teams unable to trace which upstream source caused downstream report errors.\n- **Regulatory Non-Compliance:** Severe exposure to DPDP, GDPR, HIPAA, and SOC 2 fines due to unmapped sensitive data.\n- **Ungoverned Data Access:** Coarse-grained access controls allowing unauthorized visibility into confidential customer records.\n\n### HOW WE ENGINEER IT\n\n- **Automated Column-Level Lineage:** End-to-end visual mapping tracing data provenance from source tables to BI dashboards.\n- **Continuous Quality Testing:** Declarative Great Expectations and dbt test suites validating schema integrity and anomaly thresholds.\n- **Centralized Metadata Catalogs:** Unified data discovery portals indexing assets, business glossaries, and ownership tags.\n- **Dynamic Data Masking & RBAC/ABAC:** Role-based and attribute-based security policies enforcing zero-trust data access.\n\n### BUSINESS OUTCOMES\n\n- **100% Audit Readiness** for DPDP, GDPR, and ISO/SOC 2 governance mandates\n- **90% Faster Root-Cause Analysis** on pipeline bugs using automated lineage\n- **Zero Unauthorized PII Exposures** enforced by dynamic query-level masking\n- **High Trust in Business Metrics** backed by continuous data quality SLAs",
      "businessProblems": [
        "Unverified data quality causing erroneous executive reporting",
        "Unclear column-level data lineage across analytical pipelines",
        "DPDP, GDPR, and SOC 2 regulatory compliance exposure",
        "Ungoverned data access and lack of granular RBAC/ABAC"
      ],
      "capabilities": [
        "Automated Column-Level Lineage Mapping",
