    {
      "id": "srv_07",
      "title": "Integration Services",
      "slug": "integration-services",
      "num": "07",
      "tagline": "Modern integration across SAP, Salesforce, ERP, SFTP, REST APIs, and Kafka.",
      "summary": "Modern integration across SAP, Salesforce, ERP platforms, SFTP, REST APIs, event-driven systems, cloud services, and enterprise applications.",
      "description": "Modern integration across SAP, Salesforce, ERP platforms, SFTP, REST APIs, event-driven systems, cloud services, and enterprise applications.",
      "content": "### WHAT WE DO\n\nWe engineer enterprise application integrations connecting SAP, Salesforce, legacy ERPs, banking protocols, SFTP servers, REST/GraphQL APIs, and event-driven message brokers via LinkGenX.\n\n### BUSINESS PROBLEMS SOLVED\n\n- **Fragile Spaghetti Integrations:** Unmonitored point-to-point scripts breaking whenever third-party APIs update.\n- **Delayed Cross-System Sync:** Batch file transfers resulting in asynchronous inventory and financial discrepancies.\n- **Security & Rate Limiting Gaps:** Unsecured endpoints lacking OAuth 2.0 authentication, rate limiting, and audit trails.\n- **Manual Data Reconciliation:** Operations teams manually transcribing records between ERP and CRM applications.\n\n### HOW WE ENGINEER IT\n\n- **LinkGenX Connectivity Platform:** High-performance integration hub providing standardized enterprise connectors and schema validation.\n- **Event-Driven Kafka Architecture:** Guaranteed once-only message delivery supporting high-concurrency asynchronous workflows.\n- **Enterprise API Gateways:** Centralized management enforcing OAuth 2.0, API key rotations, rate limits, and mutual TLS encryption.\n- **Automated Dead-Letter Queues:** Intelligent self-healing retry policies with automated alerting on payload format errors.\n\n### BUSINESS OUTCOMES\n\n- **99.99% Integration Uptime** across mission-critical financial and supply chain endpoints\n- **Sub-Second Bi-Directional Sync** between Salesforce CRM and SAP ERP platforms\n- **Zero Lost Transactions** guaranteed by distributed durable message queues\n- **70% Reduction in Integration Development Time** using reusable LinkGenX connectors",
      "businessProblems": [
        "Disconnected legacy ERP, CRM, and cloud SaaS platforms",
        "Fragile point-to-point custom integration scripts",
        "Lack of centralized API rate limiting and security logging",
        "Delayed batch file syncs failing without automatic retries"
      ],
      "capabilities": [
        "Proprietary LinkGenX Integration Hub",
        "Event-Driven Kafka Event Streaming",
        "Enterprise SAP & Salesforce Connectors",
        "Secure SFTP & Cloud Webhook Orchestration",
        "OAuth 2.0 & API Gateway Management",
        "Automated Error Handling & Retries"
      ],
      "technology": [
