    {
      "id": "srv_08",
      "title": "ServiceNow Solutions",
      "slug": "servicenow-solutions",
      "num": "08",
      "tagline": "End-to-end ITSM, ITOM, ITAM, CSM, HRSD, GRC, and Flow Designer automation.",
      "summary": "End-to-end ServiceNow implementations across ITSM, ITOM, ITAM, CSM, HRSD, GRC, FSM, workflow automation, service operations, and enterprise process modernization.",
      "description": "End-to-end ServiceNow implementations across ITSM, ITOM, ITAM, CSM, HRSD, GRC, FSM, workflow automation, service operations, and enterprise process modernization.",
      "content": "### WHAT WE DO\n\nWe deliver end-to-end ServiceNow consulting, implementation, and workflow automation across ITSM, ITOM, ITAM, CSM, HRSD, GRC, and FSM — modernizing enterprise service operations.\n\n### BUSINESS PROBLEMS SOLVED\n\n- **High Mean Time to Resolution (MTTR):** Disorganized IT tickets and manual incident routing slowing employee support.\n- **Stale CMDB Configuration Data:** Outdated asset inventories causing unexpected outage dependencies and compliance blind spots.\n- **Fragmented HR & Employee Onboarding:** Disconnected provisioning steps delaying new hire productivity.\n- **Siloed Platform Integrations:** ServiceNow isolated from modern cloud infrastructure and DevOps pipelines.\n\n### HOW WE ENGINEER IT\n\n- **ServiceNow Flow Designer Workflows:** Low-code and Pro-code automated orchestration replacing manual approval hierarchies.\n- **IntegrationHub Cloud Connectors:** Direct REST and webhook integrations connecting ServiceNow to AWS, Azure, and GitHub.\n- **Automated CMDB Discovery:** Real-time infrastructure mapping and service dependency tracking across cloud and hybrid environments.\n- **AI Virtual Agent Deployment:** Conversational AI assistants automating standard employee service requests and ticket resolutions.\n\n### BUSINESS OUTCOMES\n\n- **65% Reduction in Ticket Resolution Time** via automated routing and AI triage\n- **99% Accurate CMDB Asset Discovery** across hybrid cloud environments\n- **50% Faster Employee Onboarding Cycles** through automated HR workflow orchestration\n- **Seamless Cloud Ops Integration** with bidirectional alert and incident synchronization",
      "businessProblems": [
        "Fragmented IT incident management and slow resolution times",
        "Inaccurate configuration management database (CMDB) records",
        "Manual HR onboarding and employee service request bottlenecks",
        "Lack of integration between ServiceNow and cloud infrastructure"
      ],
      "capabilities": [
