    {
      "id": "srv_09",
      "title": "Advisory Services",
      "slug": "advisory-services",
      "num": "09",
      "tagline": "Strategic cloud, AI, data, and platform modernization architecture consulting.",
      "summary": "Cloud, AI, data, operations, and modernization consulting that defines the right architecture, roadmap, technology choices, governance model, and implementation strategy before engineering begins.",
      "description": "Cloud, AI, data, operations, and modernization consulting that defines the right architecture, roadmap, technology choices, governance model, and implementation strategy before engineering begins.",
      "content": "### WHAT WE DO\n\nWe provide senior technical advisory and architecture consulting across cloud modernization, AI strategy, data platform engineering, governance frameworks, and operational roadmaps before capital investment.\n\n### BUSINESS PROBLEMS SOLVED\n\n- **Vendor Selection Risk:** Costly commitments to proprietary software platforms that fail to meet future engineering scalability needs.\n- **Cloud Migration Budget Overruns:** Projects exceeding planned timelines due to missing architectural blueprints and FinOps controls.\n- **Fragmented AI Experimentation:** Disjointed department pilots creating security vulnerabilities without business ROI.\n- **Legacy Architecture Friction:** Monolithic systems preventing rapid feature delivery and platform modernization.\n\n### HOW WE ENGINEER IT\n\n- **Target State Architecture Blueprints:** Comprehensive system schematics, component interaction diagrams, and technology trade-off matrices.\n- **3-Year Digital Transformation Roadmaps:** Phased milestone planning balancing quick-win proof of concepts with long-term platform resilience.\n- **Vendor-Neutral Technical Audits:** Deep-dive code reviews, scalability assessments, and cloud infrastructure cost profiling.\n- **AI & Data Governance Frameworks:** Enterprise policy definitions for secure LLM deployment, data privacy, and ethical AI operations.\n\n### BUSINESS OUTCOMES\n\n- **Actionable 3-Year Engineering Roadmaps** delivered with 30-day proof-of-concept milestones\n- **30%+ Initial Cloud Budget Savings** identified through architectural rightsizing\n- **Elimination of Architecture Bottlenecks** before high-cost engineering begins\n- **Executive & Board Consensus** backed by rigorous technical risk assessments",
      "businessProblems": [
        "Uncertain technology vendor selection and platform architecture risks",
        "Cloud migration cost overruns without clear FinOps planning",
        "Lack of enterprise AI governance and risk management strategy",
        "Siloed engineering teams working without unified architectural blueprints"
      ],
