    {
      "id": "srv_10",
      "title": "AI Workflow Automation",
      "slug": "ai-workflow-automation",
      "num": "10",
      "tagline": "Agentic AI workflows orchestrating multi-step business tasks and document ops.",
      "summary": "Agentic AI workflows that orchestrate multi-step business processes including document processing, reporting, customer intelligence, compliance, knowledge operations, and enterprise task automation.",
      "description": "Agentic AI workflows that orchestrate multi-step business processes including document processing, reporting, customer intelligence, compliance, knowledge operations, and enterprise task automation.",
      "content": "### WHAT WE DO\n\nWe architect and deploy autonomous, agentic AI workflows that orchestrate complex multi-step business processes — from intelligent document ingestion and compliance auditing to cross-system data operations.\n\n### BUSINESS PROBLEMS SOLVED\n\n- **Manual Back-Office Bottlenecks:** Human operators spending thousands of hours copying data between disparate enterprise applications.\n- **Delayed Compliance Filings:** Slow manual verification of complex legal, tax, and financial filings risking regulatory penalties.\n- **Disconnected Knowledge Work:** Customer inquiries requiring manual coordination across six different internal software tools.\n- **Unstructured Data Ingestion Delays:** PDF contracts and emails sitting in queues for days before processing.\n\n### HOW WE ENGINEER IT\n\n- **Multi-Agent Process Orchestration:** Stateful LangGraph autonomous agents equipped with tool calling and deterministic decision gates.\n- **Human-in-the-Loop Checkpoints:** Granular approval workflows ensuring human supervisor validation for high-stakes actions.\n- **Event-Driven Task Triggers:** Real-time webhook and Kafka triggers executing automated workflows upon document receipt.\n- **Full Operational Auditability:** Immutable event logs tracking every agent reasoning step, LLM output, and system modification.\n\n### BUSINESS OUTCOMES\n\n- **75% Operational Cycle Time Reduction** across multi-step enterprise workflows\n- **99.5% Extraction & Processing Accuracy** with automated confidence scoring\n- **100% Audit Traceability** on all autonomous agent actions and decisions\n- **24/7 Continuous Execution** of complex back-office data processing pipelines",
      "businessProblems": [
        "Repetitive multi-step back-office manual data entry and reconciliation",
        "Complex customer query triage requiring cross-system lookups",
        "Manual compliance auditing across structured and unstructured filings",
        "Disconnected systems delaying executive decision cycles"
      ],
      "capabilities": [
        "Agentic Multi-Step Process Execution",
